WEBVTT

00:02:00.449 --> 00:02:02.577
I found myself
in the same hysterical state

00:02:02.618 --> 00:02:04.412
I was outside of that theater.

00:02:05.663 --> 00:02:07.874
For everybody around me, life moved on.

00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:12.753
We are hardwired to think
that this is just how the world is.

00:02:12.795 --> 00:02:15.339
Instead of asking the fundamental question

00:02:15.381 --> 00:02:16.966
of how wrong this is.

00:02:17.717 --> 00:02:22.513
I'm here and I'm fighting
for safer spaces for women

00:02:22.555 --> 00:02:25.016
by increasing their mobility,

00:02:25.057 --> 00:02:30.229
by movement of the body and mind
to take control over their lives.